DbReader Streaming Serialization for C#
Copyright 2026 Muhammet Ali Köker

This repository publishes a provider-independent evolution of Muhammet Ali Köker's
historical database-reader enumerable idea for streaming JSON/XML serialization.

The implementation contains no third-party database provider code and has no runtime
package dependency outside the .NET base class libraries used by the target framework.

